&lt;li&gt;Negotiate term sheets and definitive agreements with target companies and advisors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering to drive successful post-acquisition integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine repeatable M&amp;amp;A playbooks, templates, and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide M&amp;amp;A perspective on strategic questions and build-vs-buy decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to market analyses that inform acquisition pipeline development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support quarterly strategic reviews, annual planning, and long-range financial planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain pulse on M&amp;amp;A landscape, competitive dynamics, and emerging opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership Support&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on complex partnership structures with M&amp;amp;A-like characteristics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide deal structuring expertise on equity investments, joint ventures, and strategic alliances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evaluate acquire-vs-partner trade-offs on strategic opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10-12+ years of experience in investment banking (TMT/gaming coverage), venture capital, private equity, or corporate development at high-growth tech/media companies&lt;/li&gt;
