&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the product philosophy, vision and roadmap for &lt;strong&gt;Nitro Value&lt;/strong&gt;, covering utility, identity, expression features that drive meaningful value to subscribers and increase subscription growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional execution with a team of Engineering, Design, and Data Science to ship impactful features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other product teams across Discord, like Engagement, Core Tech, and other Consumer Revenue teams (Boosting, Identity, Shop)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly communicate roadmaps, priorities, experiments and decisions across a wide spectrum of audiences from partner teams to executive levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathize and relate to our users, especially those who are the most active on Discord&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience as a Product Manager shipping great software, driving prioritization, setting timelines, with a track record of building durable monetization infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in ambiguous environments, excited about finding solutions to complex problems, and then executing on them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and empathy for Discord users, with a deep understanding of gaming culture and online communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical ability to quickly organize and leverage data to make informed product decisions with cross-functional stakeholders. Experience making trade-offs related to achieving metric goals while ensuring we’re always delivering for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with A/B testing and experimentation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical proficiency and effectiveness working closely with engineers on user-facing products at high scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS in Computer Science, Engineering, or relevant technical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and growing consumer products, especially gaming, messaging, community, or social networking products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
